# Core Architecture & Engineering Rules

- Follow the modular monolith layer structure (L0 -> L1 -> L2 -> L3 -> L4 -> L5 -> L6 -> L7).
- Platform layer (`core/`, `shared/`, `integrations/`) MUST NOT import from `modules/`.
- Import cross-module logic ONLY via `modules/<module>/index.ts` public contracts.
- Strictly enforce multi-tenancy: `organization_id` comes ONLY from verified JWT via `TenantContext`.
- No `any` type, no default exports, no floating promises, no barrel re-export-all.
- NEVER run `git commit` or `git add` unless explicitly asked in the current message.
- Full details: [01-architecture.md](docs/ai/01-architecture.md) and [02-code-style-and-naming.md](docs/ai/02-code-style-and-naming.md)
